<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Splattanooga | Spatial Arts | Gaussian Splatting for Chattanooga</title>
  
  <!-- Flavors for the brand logo + Inter for UI/Body -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Flavors&family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-dark: #0a0c10;
      --card-bg: #12161f;
      --card-hover: #171d29;
      --accent: #00e5ff;
      --accent-purple: #7000ff;
      --text-main: #f0f4f8;
      --text-muted: #8a99ad;
      --border: #1e2633;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--bg-dark);
      color: var(--text-main);
      line-height: 1.6;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    /* Logo typography using Flavors */
    .brand-logo {
      font-family: 'Flavors', cursive, sans-serif;
      font-size: 2rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, var(--accent) 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      text-decoration: none;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .navbar {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      background: rgba(10, 12, 16, 0.85);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .nav-container {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      align-items: center;
    }

    nav a {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: color 0.2s ease;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    /* Hero Section */
    .hero {
      min-height: 75vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 4rem 1.5rem 2rem;
      position: relative;
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
      line-height: 1.15;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, #a5b4fc 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }

    .hero-subtitle {
      max-width: 680px;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
      background: rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.3);
      color: var(--accent);
      border-radius: 50px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    .cta-group {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .btn {
      padding: 0.85rem 1.75rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent) 0%, var(--accent-purple) 100%);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.25);
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--text-main);
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      border-color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    /* About Section */
    .about-section {
      padding: 6rem 1.5rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, rgba(112, 0, 255, 0.05) 0%, transparent 70%);
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .section-header {
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 0 auto 4rem;
    }

    .section-header h2 {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }

    .section-header p {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 2.25rem 2rem;
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      background: var(--card-hover);
      border-color: var(--accent);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    }

    .card-icon {
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .card h3 {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--text-main);
    }

    .card p {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

	/* Survey Results Section */
	nav a[href="/results"] {
		color: var(--text-muted);
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		transition: color 0.2s ease;
	}

	nav a[href="/results"]:hover {
		color: var(--accent);
	}
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header class="navbar">
    <div class="nav-container">
      <a href="/" class="brand-logo">splattanooga</a>
      <nav>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
		<a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1-yyPhzGzEANCGawf3Xnuo8DRulZXuLspHy5z_WBzTdY/edit?usp=drive_link" 
		  target="_blank" 
		  rel="noopener noreferrer">Survey Report ↗</a>
        <a href="mailto:rob@splattanooga.com">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero">
      <span class="badge">Community Arts Consulting</span>
      <h1 class="hero-title">Reality Capture for the Scenic City</h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">
        Exploring Gaussian Splatting, 3D scanning, and digital twin workflows across local arts, historical preservation, and creative pipelines in the Greater Chattanooga area.<br>
		Get hands-on with in-depth training, workshops, and collaborative projects that bridge technology and creativity.
      </p>
      
      <div class="cta-group">
        <a href="mailto:rob@splattanooga.com" class="btn btn-primary">Get Involved</a>
        <a href="#about" class="btn btn-secondary">Learn More</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- About Section -->
    <section id="about" class="about-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Pioneering Spatial Technology in Chattanooga</h2>
          <p>
            Splattanooga bridges advanced 3D capture methods with real-world creative application, making volumetric capture accessible for local projects and digital artists.<br>
			Our mission is to empower the community with tools, knowledge, and collaborative opportunities to explore the intersection of technology, art, and spatial storytelling.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid">
          <div class="card">
            <span class="card-icon">✨</span>
            <h3>Q. What?<br>A. Gaussian Splat Training</h3>
            <p>
              Introduction courses and workshops on Gaussian Splatting, a cutting-edge technique for rendering complex 3D scenes with high efficiency and visual fidelity.<br>
			  Let's talk and tailor this to your needs.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <span class="card-icon">🎨</span>
            <h3>Q. Who?<br>A. Community & Arts Organizations, Artists, Creatives of all types</h3>
            <p>
              Empowering local creative teams, galleries, museums, and digital artists with modern 3D pipelines, workshops, and empowerment to start generating and owning their spatial content.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>© 2026 Splattanooga. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>